OL,3,GNEWSA'Absolute angel' helped autistic
OL,4,Aboy face surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has praised a specialist who
OL,7,Fhelps children cope with being in
OL,8,Fhospital for ensuring her autistic
OL,9,Fson's "voice was heard" ahead of dental
OL,10,Fsurgery.
OL,12,FRosie said before 14-year-old Dylan's
OL,13,Ftreatment at Kettering General Hospital
OL,14,F(KGH), play specialist coordinator
OL,15,FClaire Green had "listened to us" and
OL,16,F"explained each stage in a way he could
OL,17,Fmanage".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
