OL,3,GNEWSA'Absolute angel' helped autistic
OL,4,Aboy face surgery
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter being nominated by Dylan's
OL,7,Ffamily, Green won a Star Award, given
OL,8,Fto staff at the University Hospitals of
OL,9,FNorthamptonshire (UHN) who show
OL,10,Fexceptional dedication to make a
OL,11,Fdifference to patients.
OL,13,F"Claire was a breath of fresh air ` an
OL,14,Fabsolute angel - who consistently went
OL,15,Fabove and beyond during an extremely
OL,16,Fanxious time," said Rosie.
